# The corpus is authored on macOS and Windows. Without this, a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true produces a CRLF worktree, and every \n-anchored parser
# in scripts/ reports a corrupt corpus instead of a line-ending problem.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf

# Binary assets keep their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
